Here's why I have come to understand that save scumming does
not work -

Most deaths I've had have been caused by an action I took
several levels up.  Whatever that action was it effected the game
in a way that my play became gradually untenable so my
character eventually died.  Sure, I make some dumb mistakes
and lose characters, but often I fail to use good strategy and my
game is lost long before I actually die.

You can't learn strategy from save scumming and in Nethack
strategy is overwhelmingly important.  Tactics can be learned
with save scumming but no amount of tactical care can win a
game of Nethack.  Every attempt to learn tactics when the
problem is really strategic will fail - It's a trap that save scummers
fall into.  I spent years trying it before I learned that.


